  "description": "Lotts Ezeike is a London-based founder who's perfected the art of flipping apps. His method: build apps fast, grow them to $10-20K MRR, sell them for all-cash deals, and moves on. He's done this four times and made over $500K.\n\n🚀 Build a full-stack app in minutes → https://go.starterstory.com/lotts\n\n🛠️ Build your own app with Starter Story Build → https://build.starterstory.com/build/ai-build-accelerator?utm_source=youtube&utm_campaign=lotts\n\nFollow Lotts: https://x.com/lottsnomad\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: ‪@StarterStoryBuild‬ \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\n0:00 - Intro\n1:12 - Who is Lotts\n1:31 - Sold apps\n2:10 - Background\n2:41 - The first flip story\n3:49 - Why you should build and flip\n5:00 - How to come up with app ideas\n6:16 - Build fast with Rocket\n7:07 - Build & Flip Playbook (Step-by-Step)\n11:41 - Profitable app ideas\n13:33 - Tech stack\n14:26 - Costs & margins\n15:00 - Advice\n15:57 - Final word",
